title: DeerQuestComplete
tags: quests
position: -28, -290
---
<<if $Deerquest_status == "started">>
Deer: Have you brought me those carrots?
-> Slimes: Yeah, we got them right here Deer!
    <<if $Deerquest_amount < $Deerquest_count>>
        Deer: nah you don't why you lieing, go collect more you've currently collected {$Deerquest_amount} carrots
    <<elseif $Deerquest_amount == $Deerquest_count>>
        <<set $Deerquest_status = "completed">>
        Deer: Thank you!, they can't be mad at me now!
        Deer: Here's a key for your troubles
        <<give_reward QuestGiver>>
    <<endif>>
-> Slimes: Not yet, were still missing some
    Deer: Come back when you've got all the carrots!
<<elseif $Deerquest_status == "completed">>
    Deer: thanks for helping me with those carrots!
<<else>>
    Deer: Thanks, you're a mind reader I needed those carrots!
    Deer: Here's a key for your troubles
    <<give_reward QuestGiver>>
<<endif>>
